# Test liveliness detection endpoint - Single frame
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/liveliness
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="face_image1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/your/face/image1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

###

# Test liveliness detection endpoint - Multiple frames
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/liveliness
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="frame1.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/frame1.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="frame2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/frame2.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="frame3.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /path/to/frame3.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--

